  "validationNotes": [
    "Valid vectors are canonical and satisfy policy/tree-shape/root-sum rules. Full economic admission still depends on the emitting parent's pinned admission and fee policy; obtain its actual primary quote from minMessagePrimaryFeesForTx.",
    "Declared-budget examples use an assumed primary quote to show B = P + D + surplus; producers must query minMessagePrimaryFeesForTx for the real P.",
    "The mixed Pinned vector has two roots: internal index 0 and external index 2. Internal index 1 is nested and is not added to the root-budget sum again.",
    "Unsupported enum policies fail Solidity ABI decoding; that failure is not normalized to InvalidContractDescendantGrant and no stable custom selector is asserted.",
    "A wrong root-budget sum is ABI-valid and passes the codec. validateContractDescendantGrant rejects it during allocation admission with MessageAllocationsNotEqualBudget.",
    "Legacy empty bytes decode as Closed, but keep the historical primary/remainder funding split. Explicit Closed reserves D = 0."
  ],
